# 000000book

> An open archive of motion-captured graffiti, stored as GML (Graffiti Markup
> Language) files. Running since 2009. Graffiti writers capture tags with tools
> like Graffiti Analysis, DustTag and the EyeWriter; programmers build new
> applications and visualizations on the resulting open data.

Every tag is downloadable as GML, JSON or XML. The API needs no key and no SDK:
append a format to a tag URL to read one, POST to /data to add one.

