## API

- [One tag](<%= request.base_url %>/data/154.gml): also .json and .xml
- [Newest tag](<%= request.base_url %>/latest.gml): site-wide, takes no filters
- [Random tag](<%= request.base_url %>/random.gml): site-wide
- [Filtered list](<%= request.base_url %>/data.json?app=eyewriter): also user_id, location, keywords
- Upload: POST to <%= request.base_url %>/data with a `gml` parameter

